BaseValidationLib::validateTarget
├── given RECIPIENT_IS_SPONSOR is enabled
│   ├── given recipient equals account
│   │   └── it should return valid = true
│   └── given recipient does not equal account
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given RECIPIENT is enabled (storage mode)
│   ├── given recipient passes validation
│   │   └── it should return valid = true
│   └── given recipient fails validation
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given FILL_EXPIRY is enabled
│   ├── given fillExpiry passes validation
│   │   └── it should return valid = true
│   └── given fillExpiry fails validation
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given TOKEN_OUT is enabled
│   ├── given tokenOut passes validation
│   │   ├── it should return valid = true
│   │   └── it should include tokenOutHash in targetHash
│   └── given tokenOut fails validation
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given TOKEN_OUT is not enabled
│   └── it should read pre-computed tokenOutHash from calldata
├── given multiple fields enabled
│   └── it should validate all fields and compute correct targetHash
├── given no fields enabled
│   └── it should read pre-computed targetHash from calldata
└── it should return correct targetChainId and newOffset